is is a reminder to prepare for deadline closure.','reminder',0,'2026-05-01 06:30:07','enrolled_students.php?drive_id=686'),(113,NULL,688,'Deadline Approaching: Boat','The application deadline for Boat (Drive Drive 1) is approaching.\n\nDeadline: 02 May 2026, 12:00 PM\nTime Remaining: 27.5 hour(s)\nCurrent Applications: 0\n\nThis is a reminder to prepare for deadline closure.','reminder',0,'2026-05-01 06:30:07','enrolled_students.php?drive_id=688'),(114,NULL,696,'Deadline Approaching: Deloitte','The application deadline for Deloitte (Drive Drive 1) is approaching.\n\nDeadline: 02 May 2026, 12:00 PM\nTime Remaining: 27.5 hour(s)\nCurrent Applications: 0\n\nThis is a reminder to prepare for deadline closure.','reminder',0,'2026-05-01 06:30:07','enrolled_students.php?drive_id=696'),(115,NULL,687,'Deadline Expired: Akshara Enterprises','The application deadline for Akshara Enterprises (Drive Drive 1) ended 4.5 hour(s) ago.\n\nTotal Applications Received: 0\n\nAction Required:\n1. Review all applications\n2. Prepare applicant list for the company\n3. Share the list with the company HR\n\nDeadline was: 01 May 2026, 05:00 PM','deadline',0,'2026-05-01 16:02:59','enrolled_students.php?drive_id=687'),(116,NULL,697,'Deadline Expired: PwC','The application deadline for PwC (Drive Drive 1) ended 7.5 hour(s) ago.\n\nTotal Applications Received: 0\n\nAction Required:\n1. Review all applications\n2. Prepare applicant list for the company\n3. Share the list with the company HR\n\nDeadline was: 01 May 2026, 02:00 PM','deadline',0,'2026-05-01 16:02:59','enrolled_students.php?drive_id=697');
